      "cat-harness:section": "callActivity Call_Adjudicate",
      "prov:value": "Reviewers disagreeing on ONE criterion is a criterion disagreement, so this calls the QA-criterion specialisation (bean `bvuk`, owner 2026-09-23): the failing entry stands, the criterion does not apply to this screen, or a dispensation is granted with its reason.",
